WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.430
{ED THEME}

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.400
Leave it to me, Haruka Gracia, a woman from the moon.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.070
I guess it's true that she's from the moon.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.820
A moon woman? How can you be sure, Miyuki?

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.660
If I were only staring at her chest this whole time like you, I wouldn't be.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.340
Can't help it. Her boobs are three times the size of yours.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.990
Yes, no help for it.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.230
This!

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.160
That's the emblem of the moon.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.670
Stop that!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.790
{laugh} That tickles!

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.800
This fully developed sole...

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.640
A whole suite of harmonies apparent in the shape of the footprint!

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.390
Yes, I knew it! The beauty of the arch obtained only by tramping the dirt.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.580
The gentle series of hills from the pad of the big toe to the pinky toe!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.960
What about this naughty heel?

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.360
I can <i>see</i> how it grips the ground kindly, then strikes like a sledgehammer!

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.970
Wow! It's amazing how she can talk that long about someone's foot!

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.660
Isn't that great, Dan?

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.570
No, not great! What's your problem?

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:03.410
Hey, lady!

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.270
What a dirty face. Who are you?

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:09.420
I'm Dan! Dan!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.670
You came here to meet me, right?!

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:13.480
I speak to feet.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:14.760
I'm not interested in faces.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:16.000
Put me down!

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.000
Words are false.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.080
But feet don't lie.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:22.760
Hey! Hey! Put me down! Put me down!

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.760
You want to fight that man again, don't you?

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.960
Look at a person's face when you talk to them!

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:30.810
Cosmoon! The skeletal structure, so supple and yet so tough, is declaring it to me.

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:34.610
"I want to fight... I want to settle the score with that man!"

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.820
Stop it please!

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.820
Agappe! Agappe Cosmoon!

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.120
So you took up her offer.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:41.950
Shut up!

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.410
Maybe! I'll think about it!

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:46.270
That's all I said!

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.260
Her boobs are that good, huh?

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.770
That's not the reason!

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:51.330
You're pretty good too!

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:54.270
Thanks.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:57.090
I prefer 'em the bigger the better myself.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.510
Huh?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:19.050
THREE-WAY FREE FIGHT

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.540
They're huge! Too huge!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.270
Just as I thought.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.870
Earthdash has stronger gravity than the moon.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.260
And the feet of the people opposing it are beautiful...

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.430
That way?

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.960
Got it. Thanks.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:55.140
What did you say?

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.850
We're departing immediately?

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:57.840
Yes.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.960
All your future engagements are canceled, Princess.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.460
Why? This is too soon.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.220
This place is too dangerous.

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.300
I believe the way you behaved yesterday, Princess,

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.180
was due to being overcome by the toxic miasma here.

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.730
Not at all! That was...

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.130
For you, the best thing would be to take a recuperative retreat...

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:17.730
...in the rich, natural splendors of the Kingdom as soon as possible.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.220
Come! Bring the car around; don't dawdle!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.330
We're setting off!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.390
At some point I fell asleep...

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.680
Well, whatever. Guess I'll repair it.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.740
Sela's too?!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.170
This is nice.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.540
Making deliveries using your own two feet once in a while isn't so bad, is it?

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.530
I must confess to using a motorbike, though.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.460
Found you.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.810
Just as I thought. You have proud and noble feet.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.190
Who are you?

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.240
You're seeking him, aren't you?

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.350
What?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.950
These feet are seeking a strong man.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.050
Beckoning men, then stomping them...

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:21.950
But up until now, no man could ever stand toe-to-toe with those feet.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.300
Not once.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.530
That's why you chase after one on those unsullied feet.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.070
What does that mean?

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.320
Fight him.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.660
And leave it all to me.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.430
Sela D. Miranda.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.160
Just... who are you?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.800
"Famous Shoe Designer Vanishes Mysteriously"?

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.270
Could this be...?

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:04.630
This goes like this, and this goes like...

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:08.860
Jeez, Gramps, where did you go?!

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.280
{yells} Even while the Bigfoot is getting repaired, Dangan Deliveries is still in business!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:14.450
Outta the way!

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.990
It's not bad making deliveries using your own feet once in a while.

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:17.460
Shut up!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.570
You're not the one running here!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:28.990
Hello.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.990
Dangan boy. Not making deliveries in your Bigfoot today, then?

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.830
{keh sound}Same goes for you.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:36.710
What do you want?

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.070
Keep me company for a bit?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:38.620
Why?

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.540
Let's pick up where we left off yesterday.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:41.980
As if.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:45.530
I see. Without a Bigfoot, you can't walk the walk.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.780
I don't wanna do what I don't wanna do!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.330
Dunk!

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.170
Hey. Why are you so focused on dunking?

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.430
Dunks are awesome! Dunks are cool!

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.010
That's all.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.990
If that's all, then you can't beat me.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.700
Yes I can!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:23.790
Not a chance. No matter how many times we play, I'm gonna win.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.870
This and the one before were just practice.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.990
I'm gonna be the winner when it counts!

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:34.530
Then I'll look forward to the one where it counts.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:39.000
When my Bigfoot is fixed, I'm gonna kick your ass!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.140
Oh. {don't have to sub this prolly}

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.490
What do you mean, "oh"? That hurt!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.850
Okay, kittens! Time for your milk!

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.890
Good, go drink up!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.910
Find the ones who keep their money even when they're having a good time, and milk it out of them!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.090
You don't have to pay.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:18.620
But in return, once you get as drunk as you want, I get to <i>eat</i> you.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.380
Hey, you. Who gave you permission to stand there?

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.670
No need to get hung up on minor details!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.540
<i>That</i>. That's why I hate moon women.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.050
How can you tell, Mama?

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:39.310
Moon women have huge, jutting breasts because of the low gravity.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.690
Must be nice.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.120
Mind if I sit here?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.420
Go ahead, I don't mind.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.080
Got an order?

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.510
Oh, that's right. No rules apply to moon women.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.290
Just so long as you pay.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:02.480
So close.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.500
Huh?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.500
Nothing.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.780
"Three in the Key"...

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.510
That's a good name for a bar.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:16.720
Yeah.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:21.180
The key has the shape of an actual keyhole, doesn't it?

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:21.180
<i>Note: She's talking about the shaded area of the court under the basket.</i>

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.500
You can only stay in the keyhole for three seconds.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.770
So "Three in the Key"... the three-second rule.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:32.270
The three-second rule. An excellent rule.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:34.620
It shows the wisdom of humanity.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:39.540
It governs offense and defense below the basket, and violations are used to keep both teams on equal footing.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.120
Why do you play Bigfoot Basketball?

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:48.380
What do you say to taking on Dunk Mask again?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:54.560
And I'll throw in the Platinum Hurricane, Sela Miranda, for a 1-on-1-on-1.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:59.790
Those feet give me just one answer.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.300
Okay.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:07.390
Leave it to me.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.670
Hey, pay up!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.800
I'll keep the change, Tits McGee.

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:25.140
You've been watching me for a while. You've got something you want to say?

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:29.100
I-I didn't come here followin' you.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:32.320
If something's big, I like it!

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:34.750
Then how about a big ——?

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:37.960
This.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.820
Could you try this out for me?

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:41.260
This is...

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.980
You're the whiz who brought Dunk Mask's Bigfoot...

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.530
...up to that level using the little that you had.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.490
<i>Professor</i> Souichi Ayukawa...

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:50.900
Who on earth are you...?

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.610
Just a shoemaker.

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:08.660
I sleep and I sleep, and yet I'm still as tired as ever...

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:13.040
I peek at the news I missed out on yesterday...

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:17.320
"A New Fight Moves from the Court to the City!"

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:22.380
"Crusher Who Buried City Basketball One by One Revealed as the Frozen Inferno,

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:26.440
BFB Player Iceman Hottie."

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:32.520
"Last night Iceman, Dunk Mask the Debt King, and Sela D. Miranda the Platinum Hurricane...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:37.100
...held a cutthroat free-for-all somewhere in Rollingtown.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:42.800
Though it was cut short by police interference, some citizens call for a rematch.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.690
The Police report they are hot on the trail of the three mechs.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.530
"Ultimate Bystander, signing off," he writes.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.920
Man, are those police slow.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:56.550
You shouldn't be "hot on the trail" when you already know who did it!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:00.780
Plus two of the three mechs are right her—

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:01.590
What?!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.300
"Fracture"? "Dislocation"? "Upgrade"?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.100
Now I've got a full set!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:09.220
All three of them are right here!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:16.460
All right! If this is how it's gonna be, I'm gonna freakin' rebuild them from the core out!

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:19.530
Ganz! Bel!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:20.280
Hey.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:21.690
What's up?

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.150
Have at it!

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.010
They're multiplying.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.310
Not a problem, not a problem!

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.570
We've got all three.

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.040
Oh, Gramps, where'd you—!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:42.260
What? You fall for Lunar busts too?

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:46.360
{heeh sound}So that's called a Lunar bust!

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:50.360
I wondered where you were out doddering around when we were so busy. Figures.

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:53.360
I like anything as long as it's big!

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.310
This here's proof!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:56.860
Ganz!

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:59.190
Huh? What's this?

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.440
The work of this esteemed personage.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:08.370
Souichi and that lady seem to be on friendly terms.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.700
Maybe they get along because they both came down from the moon.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:13.830
Hey!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:38.100
This sender...

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:44.990
Coco...

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.620
I'm hungry.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:52.990
Your brother's gonna dunk the ball for sure, so c'mon and give me something to eat...

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.730
What's this?

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.110
Mail.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.450
What?

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.440
Late tonight?

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:16.560
That's right. All three mechs are here, after all.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:19.350
We'll use this junkyard as the starting point.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:23.750
Finish off the repairs and upgrades by then, please!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.840
Boy! Or young man? Whichever.

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.540
You, come with me.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:29.560
Why me?

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:31.910
I like your face!

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:35.040
You don't have to come.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:38.720
Wow, it's like a big deal all of a sudden.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:44.160
"Finish off all three mechs' repairs and upgrades by tonight, please!"...

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.290
...she said.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:52.410
"Even if they're not all there, the whistle will be blown promptly and mercilessly at midnight tonight, so be ready!"

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:55.940
What's the deal with that woman;
 doing this without even asking?!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.790
Didn't you leave it all to her?

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.350
I just said I'd think about it!

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.540
The hell with this! I'm <i>hungry</i> and I'm gonna <i>eat</i> it!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:05.430
Coco?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.750
Coco?

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:08.680
Grub.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.170
Coco?

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:16.380
Brother! You better win now!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:17.680
Coco.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:25.390
All right! Your brother's gonna eat your care package and win for sure!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:30.950
Coco, you messed up a bit though... Your care package is all in cans!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:31.770
Spanky!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.260
What the hell are you doing?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:43.910
But you know, neither the Hurricane nor the Inferno is gonna go down easy.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.240
Eating Coco's cans will give me the strength of a hundred men.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.730
No way I'll lose!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:50.410
You've got the stupidity of a thousand, just as I thought.

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:52.830
All right, I ate!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.680
Let's go, Spanky!

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:03.040
What the hell, stupid-head—

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.180
You bastard, I swear I'll eat you!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.160
Come, Spanky!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.050
What? Why?

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.560
I'm gonna win. Bel!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:22.980
Yeah, yeah.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.080
Hey Bel, hand me the wrench.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.480
Hey, Bel!

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.820
Dammit, someone give me a hand!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.930
Don't let yourself depend on them, Miyuki.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:36.300
A real engineer can't borrow someone else's hands.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.120
Grow up already.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.020
Those are—!

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.870
Go on, load them up.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.450
I dunno, maybe a little to the right?

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:50.220
Here?

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.590
Yeah, that's good!

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:55.090
This strategy might turn out to be a really good idea, Dan!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.030
Well, of course.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:16:00.080
I'll let you take your time praising me later, so let's head on to the next.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:00.880
Yeah!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:03.330
You!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.430
Ganz! When did you become that woman's lackey?

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:09.320
Not a lackey! Call me a slave of love!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.290
Dunk Mask, you're doing something intriguing.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.630
What's your strategy?

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:16.030
Dumbass! As if I'd tell you.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:18.990
All right! I'll look forward to finding out tonight.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.730
See you then!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.670
Those are big!

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:28.120
Just because they're big she thinks everyone will do whatever she wants!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.650
Oh? I meant the boxes.

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.070
Shoes!

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.550
Incredible!

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.510
So cool!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.220
I've never seen anything like it!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:43.530
I don't care what you say... I've never seen Bigfoots wearing shoes before!

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.810
You got that right!

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.020
Did it in time...

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.650
Okay! Listen up, please!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:55.900
It looks like Dunk Mask isn't here yet, but I'll go ahead and explain the rules!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.170
There are two ways to win:

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:01.490
You win if you're left standing when the other two mechs are no longer able to play.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:07.820
Or, of course, you can win by making a basket.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.720
Where's the hoop?

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.730
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.660
Dan, it's almost time for tip-off!

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:18.510
Shut up!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.450
It's nearly midnight.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.930
Operators to the cockpits.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.240
Ten seconds.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:25.810
Nine.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:26.680
Eight.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:27.560
Seven.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.900
The last. This is the last one.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:30.850
Three.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:31.770
Two.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.090
One.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.460
Oh, isn't this pretty, Princess?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.170
These shoes...

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.220
There! Is that the hoop?

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.540
That wind again...

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.200
Whoa! Awesome!

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.690
What's with these shoes?

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.040
They're so light with such a good grip!

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.690
Wait a sec! You haven't left yet?

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:17.870
Yo, Miyuki! Did you do these shoes?

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.090
Never mind that, just go!

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:23.320
Sela is gonna get murdered taking
 on Destroy all by herself!

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:27.340
Sweet! With these shoes, I can run anywhere in the city I want to go!

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:29.540
Miyuki!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.170
You should come too!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.300
Destroy!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.130
Destroy, destroy!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.930
Thanks to these shoes, my destroying power has doubled!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.270
Destroy!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.590
At this rate they don't need a hoop.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.350
Destroy is gonna win...

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:00.400
Nope, the star is about to arrive.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.220
Very well.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:10.030
As I thought, the one whose genes I'll receive...

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:14.080
...appears to be you, Iceman Hottie!

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:17.440
Just give it up, Plastic Candycane!

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:20.260
I told you, it's the Platinum Hurricane!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:21.630
Fine, fine.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:22.990
Sorry I'm late.

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:25.140
I was held up getting some arrangements in place!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.590
Oh, it's Dan.

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:27.390
He's here!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:31.720
Mister Destroy over there can't have been satisfied with just the Platitude.

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:33.480
We can tell you're doing that on purpose!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:36.060
From here on you've got me, Dunk Mask—

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:37.940
Not a patient guy!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.650
Follow Dunk Mask!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.520
This is getting interesting!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.660
Hey! What are you doing? You just gonna run away?

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.540
No!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.750
Dunk Mask!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.160
There are rules for this match—

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.410
I don't need rules!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.630
Destroy, destroy!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.460
One more! One more!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.630
Destroy!

00:19:58.900 --> 00:19:59.670
There!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:01.890
What?

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:12.720
Reading the ball's course ahead of time...

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:14.660
Is that your whole strategy?!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:16.730
Not quite!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:17.730
My real aim...

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:19.400
...is this!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.600
That idiot!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.200
No, it's right on!

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:39.750
These have a better grip than I ever imagined...

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.090
He did it!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:44.880
Amazing...

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.810
Come on! Now we're really gonna get started!

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:10.780
Is that... the legendary...?

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.410
I wanna play, I wanna play!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:18.700
Isn't Haruka arranging matches for you?

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.030
No way! I don't wanna play to someone else's tune!

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:21.950
Console yourself with that.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.000
I wanna play!

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.720
Next time, Basquash!

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:28.740
NEXT TIME

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.740
BASQUASH!

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:27.660
What's a "basquash"?
